@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### List flights with their occupancy
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/flights

### List the passengers of flight 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/flights/2/passengers

### Register a passenger (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/flights/1/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Juan Pérez",
  "documentNumber": "1799999999"
}

### Register on a full flight (409 Flight.Full)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/flights/3/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Juan Pérez",
  "documentNumber": "1799999999"
}

### Invalid data (400 Request.Invalid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/flights/1/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "",
  "documentNumber": "12"
}

### Unknown flight (404 Flight.NotFound)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/flights/999/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Juan Pérez",
  "documentNumber": "1799999999"
}

### Simulated failure (503 Server.SimulatedFailure, Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/flights
X-Simulate-Failure: true

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
